    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This idol depicts an elephant sitting on its haunches, smiling regally behind its raised trunk.</p><p><strong>Blemished (Uncommon).</strong> The idol is made of tarnished bronze, its surface marked with small dings and dents.</p><p>You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAugury0000]{Augury} from the idol, which speaks the omen aloud in answer. Once the idol has been used to cast this spell, it can’t be used to cast it again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-7OKJ3hDls9V5sxaO\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Cette idole évolue : chaque version garde les propriétés des précédentes. Quand elle évolue, remplacez-la par la version suivante (Blemished, Tarnished, puis Golden).</p></section>",
